-- erwartet: H022
-- **A mutual call cycle without a descent measure (must fall).**
--
-- `ping` calls `pong` calls `ping`, and neither declares `decreases`. On a cycle every
-- edge counts the DECLARED `costs` of the callee once (`SPRACHE.md` §7), so each promise
-- is an assumption, not a result -- and without a measure nothing turns it into one.
-- `K008` refuses each bare member; the self-recursive shape stands in `gift/150`.
--
-- The composition premise this pins: a termination argument must cover EVERY member of
-- the cycle, not just one of them. The half-covered cycle (one measure) is `gift/747`,
-- the three-member cycle `gift/748`, and the rule this will become is `H022`
-- (`messung/PFLICHTEN-ORDNUNG.md`).
module gift::wechselruf_ohne_mass {

static mut a : u32 = 0;

impl fn ping(n : u32) -> u32 effects { writes a } costs <= 8 ops
{ a = n; if n == 0 { return 0; } return pong(n); }

impl fn pong(n : u32) -> u32 effects { writes a } costs <= 8 ops
{ a = n; if n == 0 { return 0; } return ping(n); }

}
